<title>BELGIUM: EU confirms bloc growth forecast of 2.3 pct in '97.</title>
<headline>EU confirms bloc growth forecast of 2.3 pct in '97.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Economic Affairs Commissioner Yves-Thibault de Silguy said on Monday that the European Commission's forecast for growth in the European Union this year remained at 2.3 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;For '97, we remain at our cautious forecast of last autumn, that is to say 2.3 percent,&quot; de Silguy told reporters.</p>
<p>He also confirmed that growth was 1.6 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>BRUSSELS NEWSROOM: +32 2 287-6830</p>
</text>
